      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-108470",
      ":question/problem": "Let $X$ be a continuous random variable with the following probability density function:\n$f_{X}(x) = {3x^{2},\\begin{vmatrix}0 < x < 1 \\\\ 0,\\end{vmatrix}otherwise$\nIf $Y = X^{3}$, then what is the probability density function of $Y$?"
